  "raw_text": "{\"Figure 20\": \"Table showing global workforce by employment level for years 2017-2020, with categories: Executive & Senior Management, Management, Professional, Professional Support, Administration, Operations.\", \"Figure 20 — Vertical axis labels\": \"Executive & Senior Management, Management, Professional, Professional Support, Administration, Operations\", \"Figure 20 — Year labels\": \"2020, 2019, 2018, 2017\", \"Figure 20 — Legend\": null, \"Figure 21\": \"Table showing global workforce by age and gender for years 2017-2020, with age categories: 0–24, 25–34, 35–44, 45–54, 55–64, 65+, and gender: F (Female), M (Male).\", \"Figure 21 — Vertical axis labels\": \"0–24, 25–34, 35–44, 45–54, 55–64, 65+\", \"Figure 21 — Year labels\": \"2020, 2019, 2018, 2017\", \"Figure 21 — 2020 — Gender labels\": \"F, M\", \"Figure 21 — 2019 — Gender labels\": \"F, M\", \"Figure 21 — 2018 — Gender labels\": \"F, M\", \"Figure 21 — 2017 — Gender labels\": \"F, M\", \"Figure 21 — Legend\": \"F (Female), M (Male)\", \"Figure 21 — F\": \"F (Female)\", \"Figure 21 — M\": \"M (Male)\", \"Our COVID-19 Response\": \"Focused on operating safely and responsibly, maintaining employment and economic activity during COVID-19. Provided regular updates to employees on preventive measures, symptoms, self-assessment, and more. See page 55 of Health and Safety section for more details.\", \"Sick Leave\": \"Expanded sick leave benefits for regular employees, including no waiting period for those required to self-isolate or exposed to COVID-19. Immediate sick pay for those unwell, returning from travel, or exposed.\", \"Workplace Flexibility\": \"Implemented remote work wherever feasible, especially for working parents and employees with health conditions. Created a Flexible Work Task Force and Executive Steering Committee to expand flexible work guidelines beyond COVID-19.\", \"Supporting Mental Well-Being\": \"Expanded Employee Family Assistance Program (EFAP) globally for all employees and dependents, including mental health support. Launched telehealth in U.S., Canada, Chile. Expanded Best Doctors Mental Health Navigator in Canada. Provided mental wellness webinars for employees and families.\", \"Page\": \"84\", \"Footer\": \"Teck 2020 Sustainability Report | Forward Together\"}",
